OL,3,GNEWSAReview urged of Channel Islands'
OL,4,Arelationship
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Guernsey, Alderney and Sark
OL,7,Fare being urged to have their say on
OL,8,Fthe future of the islands after a
OL,9,Freview found some long-standing
OL,10,Farrangements may no longer meet modern
OL,11,Fneeds.
OL,13,FThe Bailiwick Commission, set up by the
OL,14,Fthree island governments in 2025, has
OL,15,Fpublished an interim report after
OL,16,Fmonths of meetings with residents,
OL,17,Fbusinesses and politicians.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
