OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReview urged of Channel Islands'
OL,4,Arelationship
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of its main findings focused on the
OL,7,F1948 Agreement, which governs much of
OL,8,Fthe relationship between Guernsey and
OL,9,FAlderney and under which Guernsey
OL,10,Fprovides services including healthcare,
OL,11,Feducation and policing.
OL,13,FThe commission said the agreement was
OL,14,F"increasingly difficult to apply to
OL,15,Fmodern services and governance
OL,16,Farrangements".
